{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "90f37141564ccd36c5cf339683b9418c47194b837c98e3ea8edb7b7b9e3466f2", "ja": "PRETTYな新曲！", "zh": "PRETTY的新歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "352536e69dcf96838a6b3ee04de754495a8173a43623d67167d80f8edaac578f", "ja": "社長から託された新曲『PRETTY DREAMER』を\n歌う事になった5人。先輩は自分だけだと\n張り切る響。メンバーに自分をねーねーと\n呼ばせようとするが、奈緒には抵抗される。\n公演まで仲良くな！と言うプロデューサー。", "zh": "五人负责演唱社长托付的新歌\n『PRETTY DREAMER』。\n由于前辈只有响一个人，以致她很有干劲。\n响希望成员们都叫她姊姊，不过奈绪不愿意。\n制作人则喊话：「到公演前都要好好相处！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "936d7825ea1594eb5c2f69ff1a0ddfc5c4e9ab896bc28661ce6aa5c2b3f3ae01", "ja": "（今年も残りわずかだが、最後まで皆と一緒に\n全力で駆け抜けよう。そのためにも、まずは……）", "zh": "（今年也快到尾声了，就跟大家一起全力冲刺到最后吧。\n为此首先要……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1001_null", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c9fe9a314ebe0a784c6c4987364b9cf3e37385fd7de49cbd482d09b907e0ac05", "ja": "おはよう。全員そろっているか？", "zh": "早安，大家都到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "52ecf13ef6d0bfb4efebf5b383301b3e9de4ac4d8a5154c4347ef277a8340304", "ja": "おはようございます、{$P$}さん。\nはい。あとは、奈緒ちゃんだけですよ。", "zh": "早安，{$P$}先生。\n嗯，只剩奈绪还没到而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d94b1e5e9a37f9776350a679d2c68cab2837782544c5f9a2f05c0a296c8f271c", "ja": "あれ、奈緒はまだ来てないのか？\nどうかしたのかな……。", "zh": "咦，奈绪还没来吗？\n是不是发生什么事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1005_null", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "3d5bcf9efb87ec5b88247bf9d60c1c4f4f1265a0009396c5c95247af66ada04b", "ja": "うはー、遅刻してすみません～！\n近所のおばちゃんと喋りこんでて、遅れました！", "zh": "呜啊～不好意思我迟到了～！\n跟邻居大婶聊天聊一聊就来迟了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "3920bf981af63921213598660186cda96718be744fce72d4cb98ca184bf326f3", "ja": "もー、奈緒！　うちなータイムはよくないぞ！\n時間はちゃんと守らなくちゃ！", "zh": "真是的，奈绪！迟到习惯不好喔！\n要守时才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "ceb1c861d6d783006e349c8f9c934dad9a55fb7f353bfa779f6cbc20b67c6c6c", "ja": "ゴメンゴメン、響！　次から気つけるわ！", "zh": "抱歉、抱歉，响！我下次会注意的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "ed904877d8ea3a28addc400d89a5528b1c4b28b173bae7ee85dd341e84e89e4c", "ja": "それで、{$P$}さん。\n私らに話って何ですか？", "zh": "那么，{$P$}先生。\n你要跟我们说什么事呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a8c3f395f29723961abcbc93b9b4ec4349897deac8746577d3df5df14b54c2a4", "ja": "ああ。次の公演では、このメンバーで\n新しい曲を歌ってもらおうと思ってな。", "zh": "哦，我希望请在场的各位成员，\n于下次公演时演唱新歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7249d01a797dea3b1fb29e0187a105312135d46fb83e977743e3b41a138ec2fe", "ja": "まずはみんな、曲のデモを聞いてくれ。\nこの曲なんだけど……。", "zh": "首先，请大家先听新歌的DEMO。\n就是这首歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "1fb9ba96ba9f3a001c3118c06a7ca3b7834034cb22378cc8a18b3318d0aeeb46", "ja": "わぁっ♪　『PRETTY DREAMER』、\nとっても、とーっても楽しそうな歌ですね♪", "zh": "哇啊♪『PRETTY DREAMER』，\n感觉是唱起来非常、非～常快乐的歌耶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "6fb3998c896f9a0b9edad592ed07d7d68341fdf8f6880d27232612b2493a8367", "ja": "このメンバーで歌うの……新鮮……。\n杏奈……がんばりたい……な……♪", "zh": "由在场的成员一起唱……感觉很新鲜……\n杏奈……会加油……的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "dcdca8de5a9bedf41f8b37b1152a009103f992ec3b56d4d57b05da9470585b68", "ja": "うんっ！　がんばろうね、杏奈♪", "zh": "嗯！一起加油吧，杏奈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "83711bf239a8a678264030d7e2b37afa261cd0ec580adda6443a1a6e304701a2", "ja": "自分が、歌とかダンスとかいろいろ教えてあげるぞ！\nわからないとこあったら、じゃんじゃん聞いてね！", "zh": "不管是唱歌跳舞还是别的，本人都会教大家喔！\n有什么不懂的地方尽管问吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "da5d921fa6b2fa604a8109aab66000b2ed7d28d699610b93f70c3fd3ea6fa723", "ja": "ずいぶん張り切ってるみたいだな、響。", "zh": "你感觉很有干劲呢，响。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "d2c9b0773c7098edd9f388bfa770877c3cdbb1f535fbf903a04ffe57933720a7", "ja": "このメンバーで、センパイって自分ひとりでしょ？\nちゃんと、みんなを引っ張らなくっちゃね！", "zh": "因为这次的成员中，只有本人是前辈对吧？\n本人得好好带领大家才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3d11f43fe68ae2edbc973a6156819aee649a4220f759373e3c42b55d78b18351", "ja": "ふふっ。頼もしい先輩ね、響ちゃん♪", "zh": "呵呵，响真是可靠的前辈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "2af4e6bf82acdf5baa116e8a666dbbf39f61c776e3fad05ef7a70d9212633597", "ja": "ふふん、そうでしょ！　\n自分のこと、ねーねーだと思って頼っていいからね！", "zh": "哼哼，对吧！\n大家可以把本人当作姊姊，尽量依靠喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "3d0edb373e79343063894e657c969ded4466502473a1522af394d725f6450591", "ja": "なんなら、響ねーねーって呼んでくれてもいいぞ！", "zh": "不然叫本人响姊姊也可以喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "440ee8586d1b36f03296bb718490ada52fbb780e1c1aad6b6c3668a97e199400", "ja": "（『乙女ストーム！』の時の\n瑞希みたいなことを言うな、響……）", "zh": "（响这番话，就跟之前『少女风暴！』时\n瑞希说的一样啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "77ddd089878431badcf140a3efbc3ab18ce5df906c78bfda27caf7845045a4c2", "ja": "響ねーねー、よろしくお願いしまーす！\n私、歌を教えてほしいです♪", "zh": "响姊姊，请多多指教──！\n我想请你教我唱歌♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "9827a598857b9b90c7cb3ffb99c8f3b27e391bd998224dc4440278c7983ac4e7", "ja": "杏奈は……ダンス、教えてほしい……。\n響ねーねー……、よろしく……です……♪", "zh": "杏奈……想要学舞蹈……\n响姊姊……请多……指教……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "d9426c48e28f9467501a64b5e60ec332189c753d1b2fb7cbf1dd93fe8ea228ce", "ja": "（『乙女ストーム！』の時みたいな\n反応だな、ふたりとも……）", "zh": "（这两人的反应，\n也跟之前『少女风暴！』时一样啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1025_013hib", "source_sha256": "f3a1c89b157b5613a7d4d2476237de934f906add0b4c1b1bc75d27d9cca3e947", "ja": "うんうん、任せといて！\n自分がカンペキに教えてあげるぞ！", "zh": "嗯嗯，交给本人吧！\n本人会完美地教导你们喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1026_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c6bdeaed50ed23c2d2b9de855c0b49e6aef5fd0ba3407028869cfde62822aea4", "ja": "響ちゃん、私より年下なのにすごいなぁ。\n私も、こんなふうに自信を持てる日が来るのかな？", "zh": "响的年纪比我小，却很厉害呢。\n我以后也有机会像你这样充满自信吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1027_041fuk", "source_sha256": "62263c5086535e550dee2517f41e9946992e8bd410ebe69e220d3a1d8a2bf38c", "ja": "私も響ちゃんみたいに……ううん、\n響ねーねーみたいになれるよう、がんばらなきゃ♪", "zh": "我也得努力，变得跟响一样……不对，\n变得跟响姊姊一样有自信♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "6873ec77bebfa461420848fe9f927432644c8b1c4796a08d8302667023d53dfa", "ja": "風花にまで、ねーねーって言われると、\nくすぐったいけど……でも、エンリョしなくていいぞ！", "zh": "连风花都叫本人姊姊，感觉有点难为情……\n不过不用客气，尽管叫吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1029_013hib", "source_sha256": "e357284610764150bdfa9dfcc0b08bd8a8d97f0a8b9eaa6bc710290b902fc027", "ja": "ほら、奈緒も！\n響ねーねーって呼んでみて！", "zh": "来，奈绪也一起！\n叫一次「响姊姊」看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1030_037nao", "source_sha256": "fa54e31ee4c6f35247d0fdc85887f7b61455c9da4f4f657f93d7919351b03440", "ja": "えー！？　私の方が年上やのに、\nなんで響をねーねーって呼ばなあかんねん！", "zh": "咦──！？明明我的年纪比较大，\n为什么非得叫你姊姊才行呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1031_013hib", "source_sha256": "b173a450f191e7592491be8f1ac40bc58d6aeb5dca3570a752053a479dc4a335", "ja": "いいでしょ、別に！\n1回だけでいいから呼んでみて！　ね！", "zh": "这又没什么大不了的！\n试着叫一次看看啊！好嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1032_037nao", "source_sha256": "89c4f1570f558e1bb2f114a5da54f0db868eaa0b420df15358b4741cd67a64bc", "ja": "イヤや！　絶対呼ばん！", "zh": "我才不要！绝对不叫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1033_013hib", "source_sha256": "f5033289a25dd2580f88bbb0bc8ffb6b1680b7871c1141e1757ed779d1516f8f", "ja": "奈緒のケチ！", "zh": "奈绪小气鬼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1034_037nao", "source_sha256": "b8d76372a4a5aaf6c67500f25d24759dc1e1ff4b18945638a108b826610a4e9f", "ja": "ケチって言うた方がケチや！", "zh": "说人小气的才是小气鬼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1035_013hib", "source_sha256": "9d98bc23d28afc80c1565c44c8233eee01ced8dafa80cc6ece59525e9e007ea3", "ja": "えっ、そうなの！？\n{$P$}、自分、ケチだったのか！？", "zh": "咦，是这样吗？\n{$P$}，原来本人很小气吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1036_p", "source_sha256": "ed1f9500edffa0058c4c282620abb6ff6e75b18d6fda5895818579a021f82f6b", "ja": "大丈夫、二人ともケチじゃないから。\n……ともかく、公演までみんな仲良く頑張ってくれよ！", "zh": "没事的，你们都不是小气鬼。\n……总之，到公演前大家都要好好相处、一起加油喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_01_1037_013hib", "source_sha256": "9c1ec5e6eb430f0be966a9886391f3e0dfeb44f0e8a64ac1af17cc806edc419c", "ja": "うんっ！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
